// [TYPE-ANY] [CONCURRENCY-HANDLES] A fiber hands its result back as an unboxed
// word, so a `Fiber<int>` cannot travel as a `Fiber<any>`: `await` read the raw
// 7 as an `any` box and the program segfaulted (exit 139) with no message.
fn sevenLater() = 7
fn awaitErased(fib: Fiber<any>) = await(fib)
print(toString(awaitErased(spawn sevenLater())))
